  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hKaK8BE.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>透過更流暢的過場動畫、可自訂的選單以及動態UI元件，提升您的遊戲體驗。享受沉浸式且直覺的介面，讓您的Minecraft世界前所未有地栩栩如生。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UHOcBu4.gif\" alt=\"\"></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>目前，IUI提供以下功能：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>稀有度較高的手持物品（游標上的物品）會產生粒子軌跡</li>\n<li>在物品欄中快速移動手持物品時，物品會搖晃</li>\n<li>游標下的物品會縮放</li>\n<li>流暢的快捷欄選擇器動畫</li>\n<li>容器中與游標物品相符的物品會漂浮顯示</li>\n<li>還有更多功能！</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fTMTKyIY.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://i.imgur.com/TMTKyIY.png</a>)</p><ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.x：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></li>\n<li><strong>1.20.1：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NeoForge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Quilt</strong></a></li>\n</ul><div style=\"text-align:left\">如果您願意，可以在您的模組包中使用此模組 ;)</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KSJusYp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div><p>undefined</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/immersive-ui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-ui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fimmersive-ui%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fimmersive-ui%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dImmersive%2bUI%2b(from%2bwww.curseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">**想試試我們的其他模組嗎？ - 前往 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 了解更多資訊！**</p>",
